m0001","quote":"述有心虛疾，性理時或乖謬。除吳郡太守，以疾不之官。病差，補吳興太守，在郡清省，為吏民所懷。十二年，卒，時年四十六。喪還京師，未至數十里，殷景仁、劉湛同乘迎赴，望船流涕。十七年，劉湛誅，義康外鎮，將行，歎曰：「謝述唯勸吾退，劉湛唯勸吾進，今述亡而湛存，吾所以得罪也。」太祖亦曰：「謝述若存，義康必不至此。」","intervening_paragraph_ids":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p007","quote":"述有心虛疾，性理時或乖謬。除吳郡太守，以疾不之官。病差，補吳興太守，在郡清省，為吏民所懷。十二年，卒，時年四十六。喪還京師，未至數十里，殷景仁、劉湛同乘迎赴，望船流涕。十七年，劉湛誅，義康外鎮，將行，歎曰：「謝述唯勸吾退，劉湛唯勸吾進，今述亡而湛存，吾所以得罪也。」太祖亦曰：「謝述若存，義康必不至此。」","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p007:m0001"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p008","quote":"三子：綜、約、緯。綜有才藝，善隸書，為太子中舍人，與舅范曄謀反，伏誅。約亦坐死。緯尚太祖第五女長城公主，素為約所憎，免死徙廣州。孝建中，還京師。方雅有父風。太宗泰始中，至正員郎中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p008:m0002"}],"interpretation_note":"謝述完整附傳末之三子清單；分別保存兩段，不把父名插入原子段，不以列表次序推絕對排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p007","c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p008"],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"完整謝述附傳末相鄰原段：前段述為已具名主體，次段三子明列綜、約、緯；分存原句與兩端MID，不把父名插入子段。"}}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-song052-xie_yue","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCC","surname":"謝","ming":"約","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p008"